{"meta":{"ui":"expenses","model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","form":"notation","designSystem":"cards","turn":"generate","prompt":"I have four expenses from one report waiting for my approval: Delta Air Lines, Travel, Nov 3, $412.60; Blue Bottle Coffee, Meals, Nov 4, $18.40; Uber, Transport, Nov 5, $36.25 (no receipt attached); WeWork day pass, Office, Nov 6, $45.00. Show them in a card with merchant, category, date and amount, flag the one missing a receipt, and let me approve or reject each (changing my mind is fine). Show how many are approved (\"N of 4 approved\") and the approved total, and a Submit button; after I submit, the card says Submitted with the count and the total.","text":"ChatCard \"Expense approvals\" \"Report with 4 expenses\" icon:\"receipt_long\" status:\"Pending\" tone:accent w:390\n  state items=[{\"id\":1,\"merchant\":\"Delta Air Lines\",\"cat\":\"Travel\",\"date\":\"Nov 3\",\"amount\":412.60,\"receipt\":true,\"d\":\"\"},{\"id\":2,\"merchant\":\"Blue Bottle Coffee\",\"cat\":\"Meals\",\"date\":\"Nov 4\",\"amount\":18.40,\"receipt\":true,\"d\":\"\"},{\"id\":3,\"merchant\":\"Uber\",\"cat\":\"Transport\",\"date\":\"Nov 5\",\"amount\":36.25,\"receipt\":false,\"d\":\"\"},{\"id\":4,\"merchant\":\"WeWork day pass\",\"cat\":\"Office\",\"date\":\"Nov 6\",\"amount\":45.00,\"receipt\":true,\"d\":\"\"}]\n  state submitted=false\n  if !submitted\n    SectionLabel \"Expenses\" \"{count(items,x=>x.d=='approved')} of 4 approved\"\n    each x in items\n      Card gap:8\n        Row between middle\n          Text.strong \"{x.merchant}\"\n          Text.strong \"{money(x.amount,'$',2)}\"\n        Text.muted \"{x.cat} · {x.date}\"\n        if !x.receipt\n          Callout \"No receipt attached\" \"Consider rejecting or requesting one.\" tone:warn icon:\"warning\"\n        Row gap:10\n          ActionButton \"Approve\" tone:good icon:\"check\" -> items=updateWhere(items,y=>y.id==x.id,y=>with(y,\"d\",\"approved\"))\n          ActionButton \"Reject\" tone:danger icon:\"close\" -> items=updateWhere(items,y=>y.id==x.id,y=>with(y,\"d\",\"rejected\"))\n        if x.d!=\"\"\n          Text.caption \"Marked {x.d}\"\n    TotalBar \"Approved total\" \"{count(items,x=>x.d=='approved')} of 4 approved\" amount:=money(sum(filter(items,x=>x.d=='approved'),x=>x.amount),\"$\",2) cta:\"Submit\" -> submitted=true\n  if submitted\n    Receipt \"Submitted\" \"{count(items,x=>x.d=='approved')} of 4 approved, total {money(sum(filter(items,x=>x.d=='approved'),x=>x.amount),'$',2)}\" tone:good icon:\"check\"","usage":{"input_tokens":9138,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":803,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard","output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0}},"ttftMs":848,"totalMs":4842}}
